OL,3,AThree Kyiv bridges hit during major
OL,4,ARussian missile attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia has targeted bridges in Kyiv and
OL,7,Fkilled six during one of the largest
OL,8,Fair attacks of the war so far, days
OL,9,Fafter Ukraine inflicted heavy damage on
OL,10,Fthe strategically important Crimean
OL,11,FBridge.
OL,13,FTwo people were also killed in Russian
OL,14,Fstrikes on a railway station in the
OL,15,Fwestern city of Lviv.
OL,17,FBallistic missiles hit three bridges
OL,18,Fover the Dnipro River, vital routes
OL,19,Fwhich people in Kyiv rely on to move
OL,20,Faround the city.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
